---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { PRINCIPLES, SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Page
  title="About"
  label="About"
  heading="About Crackbot"
  intro="A security research group and think tank."
>
  <p>We all work in cyber security. Crackbot is how we give something back to the community we learned from: we research, write up what we find, and share tools when they are ready.</p>
  <p>We are independent, and nobody outside the group decides what we publish.</p>

  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <ul>
    {PRINCIPLES.map((p) => <li><strong>{p.title}.</strong> {p.body}</li>)}
  </ul>

  <h2>Find us</h2>
  <p>Our code is on <a href={SITE.github} rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>. For anything else, see the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</Page>
